<%# Template text. Replace every [bracketed] value and check the times match your courier partners. %>
<%- include('../partials/info-start', { heading: 'Shipping and delivery policy', lead: 'Where we deliver, how long it takes and what it costs.', updated: true }) %>
<article class="doc section-box">
  <div class="doc-summary">
    <div><strong><%= store.dispatchDays %></strong><span>to pack and dispatch</span></div>
    <div><strong><%= store.deliveryDays %></strong><span>to deliver to most PIN codes</span></div>
    <div><strong>Free over <%= formatPrice(store.freeDeliveryMin) %></strong><span>otherwise <%= formatPrice(store.deliveryFee) %> per order</span></div>
  </div>

  <h2>1. Where we deliver</h2>
  <p>We deliver across India through our delivery partners. Some remote PIN codes may take longer or may not be served. Check the delivery information for your PIN code before placing an order.</p>

  <h2>2. Delivery times</h2>
  <p>Orders are packed and handed to the courier within <%= store.dispatchDays %> after online payment or Cash on Delivery confirmation, not counting Sundays and public holidays. Delivery usually takes <%= store.deliveryDays %> after dispatch, depending on your location.</p>

  <h2>3. Delivery charges</h2>
  <p>Delivery is free on orders of <%= formatPrice(store.freeDeliveryMin) %> or more. Smaller orders pay a flat <%= formatPrice(store.deliveryFee) %>. The exact charge is always shown before you pay.</p>

  <h2>4. Tracking</h2>
  <p>When your order ships we email you the courier name and tracking number.</p>

  <h2>5. Failed delivery</h2>
  <p>If the courier cannot complete delivery and returns the parcel to us, any amount already paid for the returned items is credited to the Nexthlon wallet according to our <a href="/refund-policy">cancellation and wallet credit policy</a>. No Cash on Delivery amount is collected for an undelivered parcel.</p>

  <h2>6. Questions</h2>
  <p>Write to <%= store.supportEmail %> or use our <a href="/contact">contact form</a>.</p>
</article>
<%- include('../partials/info-end') %>
